    "markdown": "# Caucasus {#sec-caucasus .unnumbered}\n\nCaucasus is situated between the Black Sea and the Caspian. The broader Caucasus encompasses south regions of Russia, but in this chapter we will focus on Azerbaijan, Armenia and Georgia.\n\n![Caucasus](images/caucasus.png){#fig-caucasus width=\"80%\"}\n\nAll three countries are former Soviet republics which gained their independence in 1991.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {#fig-azerbaijan_armenia_georgia .cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"echarts4r html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-9f9f9c9a7b7ce630ee32\" style=\"width:100%;height:500px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-9f9f9c9a7b7ce630ee32\">{\"x\":{\"theme\":\"azul\",\"tl\":false,\"draw\":true,\"renderer\":\"canvas\",\"events\":[],\"buttons\":[],\"opts\":{\"yAxis\":[{\"show\":true,\"name\":\"Population\"}],\"xAxis\":[{\"type\":\"value\",\"name\":\"Year\",\"min\":1950,\"max\":2026}],\"tooltip\":{\"trigger\":\"axis\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"legend\":{\"data\":[\"Armenia\",\"Azerbaijan\",\"Georgia\"]},\"series\":[{\"data\":[{\"value\":[1950,1382894.5]},{\"value\":[1951,1417283.5]},{\"value\":[1952,1454106.5]},{\"value\":[1953,1493577.5]},{\"value\":[1954,1535978.5]},{\"value\":[1955,1581508]},{\"value\":[1956,1630818.5]},{\"value\":[1957,1684134]},{\"value\":[1958,1740884]},{\"value\":[1959,1801008.5]},{\"value\":[1960,1863705]},{\"value\":[1961,1927484]},{\"value\":[1962,1991689]},{\"value\":[1963,2056023]},{\"value\":[1964,2120135.5]},{\"value\":[1965,2183634.5]},{\"value\":[1966,2246158.5]},{\"value\":[1967,2307491.5]},{\"value\":[1968,2367319]},{\"value\":[1969,2424030]},{\"value\":[1970,2475632.5]},{\"value\":[1971,2525345.5]},{\"value\":[1972,2577078.5]},{\"value\":[1973,2630860.5]},{\"value\":[1974,2686445]},{\"value\":[1975,2743660]},{\"value\":[1976,2818165]},{\"value\":[1977,2912827.5]},{\"value\":[1978,3012806.5]},{\"value\":[1979,307850